                "Why is the crucible project teaser so fundamentally critical? Consider how most developers describe their past experience: 'In my past roles, I have worked on web applications, built APIs, collaborated with QA, and participated in agile ceremonies.' This statement provides zero technical signal! An intern can say that; a bootcamp graduate can say that; an outsourced contractor can say that. It sounds like generic corporate background noise.",
